CHAPTER.VERS:
You are the daughter of your mother, that loathes her husband and her sons; and you are the sister of your sisters, who loathed their husbands and their sons: your

          {+}
         mother was a Hittite, and your

          {+}
         father an Amorite.

And your sisters, Sodom and her daughters, will return to their former estate; and Samaria and her daughters will return to their former estate; and you and your daughters will return to your

          {+}
         former estate.
